	PAGE

/ TEXT MESSAGES DISPLAYED WHEN REQUESTING THE WPS UTILITY SOFTWARE
/
/-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/ TWO DRIVE SYSTEM	|  REMOVE THE DISKETTE FROM DRIVE 0 AND INSERT THE
/ VALIDATION ERROR  VE1	|  WPS UTILITY SOFTWARE DISKETTE AND PRESS RETURN
/ DRIVE NUMBER ERROR	|
/ RETURN OR GOLD MENU	|  OR PRESS GOLD MENU TO RECALL THE MAIN MENU.
/-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
