/ GET DENSITY ERROR DE1	|  INTO DRIVE 1 AND PRESS RETURN
/ DRIVE NUMBER ERROR	|
/ RETURN OR GOLD MENU	|  OR PRESS GOLD MENU TO RECALL THE MAIN MENU.
/-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
