/ NO DEFAULT SET    GDR	|  WPS UTILITY SOFTWARE AND PRESS RETURN
/ DRIVE NUMBER REQURIED	|
/ GOLD MENU		|  OR PRESS GOLD MENU TO RECALL THE MAIN MENU.
